WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.549
And back again.

00:02.249 --> 00:05.509
After full, the dark comes in from the other edge.

00:05.959 --> 00:11.053
The Moon rises later every night, until it is a thin crescent in the dawn.

00:11.503 --> 00:15.691
Twenty-nine and a half days after it began, it is new again.
